   "source": [
    "# Inertial Mass Reduction (IMR) Model\n",
    "**Replicating Salvador Pais' patents for UAP propulsion.**\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Equations from Pais' Patents:\n",
    "- **Mass Reduction**: `m' = m * (1 - (B² / (2μ₀c²)))`\n",
    "- **EM Field Strength**: `B = μ₀ * I * N / (2πr)`\n",
    "- **Required Current**: `I = sqrt((2μ₀c² * (1 - m'/m)) / (μ₀²N² / (4π²r²)))`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# Constants\n",
    "mu_0 = 4 * np.pi * 1e-7  # Permeability of free space (H/m)\n",
    "c = 3e8  # Speed of light (m/s)\n",
    "\n",
    "# UAP parameters\n",
    "m = 1000  # Initial mass (kg)\n",
    "N = 1000  # Number of coil turns\n",
    "r = 0.5   # Coil radius (m)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Target: 90% mass reduction\n",
    "m_prime_target = m * 0.1\n",
    "B_required = np.sqrt(2 * mu_0 * c**2 * (1 - m_prime_target / m))\n",
    "I_required = (B_required * 2 * np.pi * r) / (mu_0 * N)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Required B Field: {B_required:.2e} Tesla')\n",
    "print(f'Required Current: {I_required:.2e} Amperes')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Plot mass reduction vs B field\n",
    "B_range = np.linspace(0, B_required * 1.1, 100)\n",
    "m_prime_range = m * (1 - (B_range**2 / (2 * mu_0 * c**2)))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "plt.plot(B_range, m_prime_range, 'b-', label='Effective Mass')\n",
    "plt.axhline(m_prime_target, color='r', linestyle='--', label='Target (10% mass)')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Magnetic Field Strength B (Tesla)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Reduced Mass m\' (kg)')\n",
    "plt.title('Inertial Mass Reduction vs. EM Field Strength (Pais Patent)')\n",
    "plt.grid(True)\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  }
